cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Mechanome/curvo, cite this software and record the exact commit used."
title: "Mechanome/curvo: models and inference tools for cell mechanics"
abstract: >-
  Mechanome develops models and inference tools for cell mechanics. Its curvo
  engine searches membrane-curvature models and performs conditional inverse
  inference with synthetic recovery checks. The CME campaign reports descriptive
  geometry results and mathematical identifiability limits. The assessed public
  cap-fit tables do not establish biological mechanism selection or calibrated
  force recovery. Synthetic calibration is conditional on the observation model.
type: software
